Sec. 2 of the Decree is hereby amended to read as follows:
"Sec. 2. The Deputy Minister of National Defense for Civilian Relations shall have the following functions:
a. Establish and maintain effective liaison between the Ministry of National Defense and the Ministry of Local
Government and local governments, for the purpose of coordinating local development efforts;
b. Promote coordination and cooperation between the units of the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) in
the field and local executives and authorities;
c. Develop programs and formulate policies and guidelines for the supervision and operation of the Office of
Civil Relations (OCR);
d. Formulate and oversee the implementation of troop information programs designed to instill in the soldier
the conviction and determination to uphold and advance the ideals of the New Society;
e. Formulate and oversee the implementation of public information programs that will enhance the prestige of
the armed services and thereby inspire the confidence of the people in the organization;
f. Monitor the activities of military units/personnel assigned to civilian agencies of the government;
g. Oversee the activities of veterans organizations; and
h. Such other functions as the Minister of National Defense may assign to him from time to time."
